{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】APEC財長會結束，部分代表到故宮文化博物館參觀。</p>\n<p>APEC財長會閉幕後，部分與會代表下午乘坐旅遊巴到達故宮文化博物館。在西九文化區管理局首席財務總監李家文帶領下，參觀約40分鐘後離開。代表團之後會坐船在維多利亞港觀光。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T08:20:01.701599+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T08:03:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T09:17:46.290207+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T08:17:41.924119+00:00","content_hash":"08e0b7cf162ab1bd84046a4ff8b8e299dc0131755fe1177bc30408c7a89b1bbe","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}